{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_rockr_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_rockr_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"六百鎊","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_rockr_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"da00f11fad04b0c4c3cef18beef2b0ae15a4b9103ec1604744d9655b77ab977c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"拿著，趕緊走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我點了數額就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"總共六百鎊，你擺什麼譜？再說聯合源石工業這麼大的集團，還能欠你一個人的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我點了數額再走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你愛怎麼樣就怎麼樣吧，我也不急在這一時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵路廢線快兩年，你是最後一個簽補償金清算合約的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......五八，五九，六十。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"（長長的歎息聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"這事總算是結了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"合約你簽好了，錢你也點清了，現在你和公司沒關係了。出去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我們馬上下班，你還磨蹭什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"想什麼，錢？多一個便士也沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想公司當年許諾的那些東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"電影院，公共浴室，托兒所，工作室裡的鹽汽水。有些實現了，有些沒實現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"但我以前想，已經有的，總不會再變了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你愛想回家想去，趕緊走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"公司向你許諾的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......出去，算我求你，出去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"街燈年久失修，一半已經不亮，另一半無力地閃著，反襯得商業區方向的雪夜一片刺眼的橘黃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"工人充耳不聞，還要往前邁步，但一柄小刀已經抵在他的腰間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"錢拿出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你剛得了一筆錢。拿出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別磨蹭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你是機務段哪個工作室的？檢修工作室？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——不對，別他媽跟個領導似的問這問那，錢拿出來，別逼我動手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"聊兩句行嗎？你要是真有過不去的坎，我借你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"借？你當我沒借過？現在這光景，誰肯借一個病人錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算你借我，我還得上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"可以等你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別廢話了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我數到三，要錢還是要命，你想好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一......二......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"............三！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已經數到三了，你別逼我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的肺已經爛了，我這條命不值錢！我真捅得下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把錢拿出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快點！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"見工人毫無反應，劫匪將手中的刀往前送了送，割開了工人的衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"捅破什麼東西的感覺傳到手上，劫匪的刀尖卻觸電般往後縮了幾寸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劫匪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劫匪的話尚未說出口，工人從懷中掏出不甚厚實的信封，隔著自己的肩膀遞了過去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劫匪如臨大赦，顫抖著手將信封奪過。等到工人轉過身時，歇斯底里的劫匪已經連同補償金消失在了黑夜裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"六百鎊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"工人站了一會，慢慢走到馬路邊，在褲兜裡摸了半天，摸出一根煙來，用僅剩的一根火柴點上了。\n他深深吸一口煙，彷彿醉了一樣蹲下去。\n一點紅光在黑暗中明滅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"羅謝爾，我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"羅謝爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"羅謝爾·洛克威爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"跑哪去了？天黑了，又下著雪，我得找她去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼這麼晚才回家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽鄰居說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說你被......搶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是真的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"父親輕輕點了點頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛到他們說的地方去，那裡已經一個人都沒有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰搶了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他區的劫匪不會到我們這裡來的，一定是輕工業區的人，不會錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他甚至還知道你今天領補償金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定要讓他被抓起來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"羅謝爾，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他稍微說了幾句話，他也是沒辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他要是來好好商量，我們怎麼可能不借給他？可這是搶劫啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一他狠下心去，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"他下不去手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"真下得去手的人，會直接在背後用榔頭敲人腦袋，幾個月前那人就是那麼幹的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅謝爾打了個寒噤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"他身體實在太糟，現在這種時候，也沒人願意借他錢，他才不得不搶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都是工友，他只是一時糊塗。等到光景好起來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的會有那一天嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"會有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了嗎？幾年前你過生日，機務段的所有人一起給你用邊角料造了一架無人機，還能飛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不光機務段，其實整個輕工業區的人都是一家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"他一定會還的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，信不過爸爸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是不信，是今天下午，克拉克阿姨來央求我們借一點吃的，他們家揭不開鍋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們家有五個孩子的，你知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你晚上會帶補償金回來，就把一整條麵包......全給他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩人相對無言。\n多年前建成的房屋姑且保暖，只有窗縫裡透進來的嗚嗚聲提醒他們，窗外的雪越來越大了，風也刮了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再去克拉克阿姨家問問，看看他們還有沒有吃剩的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼大的風雪，別跑這一趟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我明天再去街上轉轉，看看有沒有廠子還要鍋爐工。實在不行，我還可以做力工活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅謝爾","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你的腰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。哪個工人沒點小傷小病？我這已經算好的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憔悴的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心我，早點睡吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"若干年後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，這裡還有一個傷患！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來了——羅伯遜叔叔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜先生，還能站起來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，我去拿擔架，麻煩你看著他！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔，您還看到其他受傷的人了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，你先別說話，堅持住，擔架馬上就來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，我算搞明白薩卡茲這次當街打人的原因了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以到底怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在輕工業區搞了個“工作禁令”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作也能禁？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了去他們佔領的工廠做工，其餘的雇傭關係全都被禁止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不就是把人逼進他們的工廠裡，把不願給他們工作的人活活餓死嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人被打，就是因為被薩卡茲發現他們在給非薩卡茲打零工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些家裡沒人的老弱病殘呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得他們會管？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這群魔族佬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去照顧那些傷得輕的人吧，我們的藥還有，省著點用就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去照顧羅伯遜叔叔，他的情況......不太好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔，這是下午的藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能坐起來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔，該吃藥了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，上午的藥你也沒吃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"照顧我......幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是倫蒂尼姆工人中的一員，我們就一定會照顧你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況爸爸跟我說過，我們輕工業區的都是一家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是鐵路機務段的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅伯遜的手緊緊抓住床單，但洛洛並未看見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"換......人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換、換人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，換個人照顧你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就去叫其他人來照顧你，但請你一定把藥吃了，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（閉上雙眼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（極輕微地點頭）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，傷患們怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷都好得差不多了，今天應該都可以回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們一走，我們也就該轉移了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，剛才羅伯遜一直在敲床。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我給他端水送飯拿藥他都搖頭，也不是要上廁所。他病得說不出話，只是一個勁兒地敲床。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜他是要你過去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我馬上去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洛洛快步走進帳篷，羅伯遜甚至還在無力地敲著床板。\n直到他睜開眼，看到洛洛的身影，單調的敲擊聲才停息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔，是要我過來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，我來了，我在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（輕輕拍了拍床）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我......坐在床邊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾片木板拼起來的床鋪，還沒一個壯實些的人寬。\n洛洛怕坐到羅伯遜，用手在床邊探了探，卻只能摸到堅硬的床板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔，我在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說你現在已經在按時吃藥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是好事呀。只有這樣，你的傷才能好得......"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅伯遜的喉嚨裡發出含混的聲響，不成話語，意思卻很明確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也對，我說這些幹什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，我們聊聊以前的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前爸爸還在的時候，他常跟我說，鐵路是輕工業區的血管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原料從鐵路源源不斷地運進工業區，進入工作室和廠房，變成產品，再由鐵路運出工業區，進入整個倫蒂尼姆，整個維多利亞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"商品是血管中流淌的血液，而鐵路工人則是組成鐵路的......組成鐵路的......那個詞是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，細胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"細胞親密無間，齊心協力，血液才能暢通無阻，細胞才能從血液的交換中得到養分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想了想，對爸爸說，那麼，火車經過時咣當咣當的聲音，就是輕工業區的脈搏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（喘息聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸想了想，誇我說得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來，火車經過時，我一想到這些話，就覺得火車聲不但不吵，反而像自己的心跳聲一樣，聽著聽著就能靜下心來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咣當，咣當......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洛洛輕輕模仿著火車的聲音，羅伯遜安靜地聽著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再後來，輕工業區的工廠一家接一家地關停，連鐵路也廢了線......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吸氣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——咳、咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我說著說著就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不說傷心事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的無人機，我叫它洛克十一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十一的意思是， 從洛克一號開始，它已經是我的第十一代無人機了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然是隊長用各種東西拼的，比不上商店裡賣的，但這裡面也有我的想法，它們也幫了我好大的忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救軍成立以來，要不是有這些無人機，我們可能已經被薩卡茲抓住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這還得感謝你，感謝爸爸在機務段的同事們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（急促的呼吸聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得嗎？我小時候過生日，機務段一起給我用各種邊角料造了一架無人機，核心引擎還是你做的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜歡得不行。雖然那架無人機飛不高，但我一有空，就讓它懸停在家裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看著旋轉的機翼，就會想，等我長大了，一定要造出更大、更好的無人機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣爸爸就不用日夜守在鍋爐旁邊，羅伯遜叔叔也不用總是在檢修的時候爬上爬下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家和和睦睦地生活在一起，下班了一起出去，喝兩瓶啤酒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含混不清的聲音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅伯遜的咳嗽聲打斷了洛洛的話。\n洛洛在他眼角看到潮濕的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不說這個了！我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅伯遜再次嘗試說話。他剛發出一點聲音，又被劇烈的咳嗽打斷了。\n等胸口的痙攣稍微緩解一點，羅伯遜費力地抬起剛剛用來敲床的那隻手，在懷中摸索起來。\n摸索了許久，他最終掏出一個小塑膠袋，裡面是裝得滿滿的錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錢......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......給我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜叔叔，這是你辛辛苦苦存下來的錢，我不能收！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（拍了拍床板）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，羅伯遜叔叔，這錢我真的不能收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，我把錢暫時收起來，等找到你的家人之後再把錢還給他們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（用力搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅伯遜渾濁的眼睛懇切地看著洛洛，但洛洛的堅決讓他望而生畏。\n他放棄了。\n他想歎氣，但他做不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他緩了口氣，再次把手伸入懷中，這次掏出來的，是一個汙跡斑斑的信封。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信封......信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，信我一定帶到，只是這個錢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伯遜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（用力敲擊床板）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不是這個意思？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洛洛把信封翻了過來，上面草草寫著幾個陳舊的字，很久以前就已經被汗水洇開：\n洛克威爾，補償金600鎊。\n洛洛瞪大了眼睛。\n然後，她看到，羅伯遜用盡全身的力氣，把塑膠袋口扯開，花花綠綠的錢撒了一地。\n十鎊的，五鎊的，一鎊的，其間還夾雜著硬幣的閃光。\n那絕對不是公司發補償金時該有的面額，只有一個便士一個便士存起來的錢才會是這樣。\n這就是羅伯遜被薩卡茲打傷最初的，也最根本的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅伯遜......叔叔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅伯遜沒有應聲。\n他像個工人一樣，耗盡了這一身血肉裡蘊藏的所有力氣，最後沉默著死去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"垂垂老矣的輕工業區迎來了不知第多少個清晨。\n薩卡茲的工作禁令卓有成效，證據就是天濛濛亮就已經往工廠進發的工人們。\n前些日子，薩卡茲們還會派幾個人來監視他們。\n但薩卡茲們後來發現，這些人如同一群行屍走肉，上工的路上永遠沉默不語，即便沒人看著，也從不會越雷池一步。\n為了勻出更多人手對付城裡此起彼伏的抵抗，薩卡茲已經不再派人監視他們了。\n貧窮和饑餓就是最盡職的監工。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緘默的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緘默的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......無人機？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一架東拼西湊的無人機迎面朝他們飛來。\n飛越第一個工人頭頂時，無人機的載貨艙打開，幾張鈔票飛舞著落下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"錢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無人機搖搖晃晃地飛過每個工人的頭頂，貨艙裡的鈔票和硬幣如同一場奇異而黏稠的雪，均勻地下在每一個工人的頭上、身邊、腳底。\n這場雪的價值，恰好是一個工作半生的人能領到的補償金的數額。\n六百鎊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"給我搜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"今天上午才從人嘴裡榨出這群渣滓的據點，我就不信他們跑得這麼快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"報告，一個人都沒有，連東西都沒了，我們只找到了這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......工業零件的盒子？就這麼放在桌上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你，射它一箭，看看有什麼鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"聽聲音像是個空盒子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"打開看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲士兵小心翼翼地打開零件盒的蓋子。\n沒有炸彈，沒有毒藥，甚至沒有用於示威的匕首。\n裡面是一個揉成一團的髒信封。\n頭目抓起信封展開，信封裡空無一物，背面不知被誰用裁紙刀整整齊齊地裁掉了一塊。\n頭目還不放心，拿著信封，對著微弱的燈光，翻來覆去地看了一會兒。\n除了污漬，上面只有幾點淚痕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g12_satellite"},{"type":"narration","text":"若干年後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？這不是你第一次給人錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。我已經記不清自己把多餘的錢給過多少人了，反正我拿著也用不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那我收下了？謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你這習慣也太奇怪了，到底是怎麼養成的？你第一次給人錢是什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是在自救軍剛成立不久的時候，我救下了爸爸的一個老同事——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洛洛抬起頭，看著鉛灰色的天空，想著這段故事該從何說起。\n她的餘光忽然瞟到路邊一座剛剛建成的建築，與四周百廢待興的樣子格格不入，樓頂上還豎著一排氣派的霓虹燈大字：\n“聯合源石工業  倫蒂尼姆工業振興總部”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
